**Different Target LLMs** Here we test our method with Claude-v1.3 as the target LLM to demonstrate its generalizability across different black-box LLMs in addition to the GPT series models. Due to the limitation of API cost, we only consider the scenarios with one-shot constraint and half-shot constraint. Similarly, we employe Alpaca-7B as the small language model for the challenges in collecting alignment data. As shown in Table 4, our method can achieve improvements over the simple prompt by 0.8 and 1.7 EM points with compression ratios of 5x and 14x, respectively.

